      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MEPUNGA SAGE (2) hit the ground running from out wide and on speed early but faded and swamped late when 7th at The Meadows in Grade 5 FIN company. Form from her last run is proving very strong. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. RATTLIN' BONES (8) shapes nicely here coming off a flying 19.23 victory at this track over 350m. This tougher but expected to be in the finish. MAGIC WESTERN (1) made contact with another runner and could manage only a distant eighth (20.14) in a Grade 4/5 over 350m at this track. Has the ability and can measure up. ELECTRA OPAL (5) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three spot most recently.",
